Part 3E — Image Compression

Before uploading any image:

Compress it.

Aim for:

Hero images: under 300 KB
Service images: under 150 KB
Logos/icons: under 50 KB

This improves page speed significantly.

Part 3F — Lazy Loading

Continue using:

loading="lazy"

for images that are below the fold (not immediately visible when the page loads).

